          "2. Time the first one for the morning: send the reminder at 9 a.m. on 10/31, the day before the booking.",
          "3. Under TCPA rules, text reminders need the client's opt-in, so ask for it when they book.",
          "4. Ask for a $20 deposit on long appointments.",
          "5. Let clients confirm or reschedule with one tap.",
          "6. Offer a waitlist to clients within 10 miles, so a freed slot fills fast.",
          "7. Publish a cancellation policy. Start from our template at /templates/cancellation-policy/.",
          "8. Track no-shows per client and follow up after the second one.",
          "9. Thank the clients who show up on time.",
